{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "a1aa70e4-089f-825c-9467-4605dad9a7e0",
  "created_at": "2026-01-11T10:38:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Priya Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:34:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Denise. Yes, hi. I know it is Sunday and City Hall is closed, so I am calling the storm number. This is the right one, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:35:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right place. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:35:14-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The storm drain on my corner is full to the top. Full! The water is just sitting there, it is not going down at all. Since the storm yesterday, the one Friday and Saturday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:35:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address, or the nearest corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:35:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am at 420 Eustis Avenue, up on Historic Hill. The drain is right at the corner by my house. Four-twenty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 420 Eustis. Is the water up in the road, or is it just the grate?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:35:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. It is a big puddle, almost a little pond, across the lane. And the cars are slowing to a crawl going through it. One by one, very slow, making waves. Somebody is going to stall, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not good. Is any water getting toward a house or a driveway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:36:09-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not in my door, no. Not yet. But it is the same, every time it rains a little, this drain does not work. Sorry, one second. [pause] No, Mateo, not near the phone. She is waving the rabbit at me, the stuffed rabbit, she wants to say hello to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:36:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello to the rabbit. Tell her I said hi back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:36:34-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She says thank you. Okay. So, can somebody come and look at the drain? Maybe it is full of leaves, or the sand from the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's usually it, debris packed in the grate or the pipe underneath. I'll put in a work order for a crew to check it. After a storm like this we've got a lot of those, but I'm marking this one as traffic affected."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I would like that. It is a little bit annoying, because I think this is not the first time I see it like this, no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:37:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note that it's a drain that backs up. Can I get a callback number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It is 401-555-0170."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:37:24-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0170, okay. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:37:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Priya Singh. S-I-N-G-H."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:37:29-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Ms. Singh. So the drain at the corner of 420 Eustis, full and not draining, traffic slowing through the water. Did I miss anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all of it. Please, when it is done, can someone call me back? So I know it is finished, and I do not need to call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:37:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll add that to the order. You'll get a call once the crew has been out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:37:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Thank you, Denise. Have a good Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T10:38:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
